---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service — LabelCropNow"
  description="Terms of service and software usage policy for the LabelCropNow client-side shipping label suite."
  canonicalPath="/terms"
>
  <div class="container static-page">
    <header class="page-header">
      <span class="badge badge-cyan">Usage Policy</span>
      <h1 class="page-title">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="page-lead">Standard terms governing the use of the LabelCropNow software utility.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="content-body card">
      <h2>1. Permitted Use</h2>
      <p>
        LabelCropNow is provided free of charge for commercial and personal use by e-commerce marketplace sellers, warehouse logistics operators, and independent shippers. You are free to crop, sort, and print shipping labels without usage quotas or subscriptions.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Software Warranty & Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>
        The software is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, express or implied, including but not limited to the warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, and non-infringement. Sellers remain responsible for ensuring printed barcodes comply with carrier optical scanning specifications before parcel dispatch.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Trademarks & Brand Acknowledgement</h2>
      <p>
        Meesho, Flipkart, Ekart, Amazon, Valmo, Delhivery, Shadowfax, XpressBees, BlueDart, DTDC, USPS, UPS, FedEx, eBay, Poshmark, Etsy, Shopify, Rollo, Zebra, Dymo, and Brother are registered trademarks of their respective owners. LabelCropNow is an independent utility and is not officially affiliated with or endorsed by these companies.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .static-page {
    padding: 3.5rem 1.25rem 5rem;
    max-width: 850px;
    background: #ffffff;
  }

  .page-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .page-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 2.8rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text-main);
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0.5rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }

  .page-lead {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .content-body {
    padding: 2.5rem;
    color: #334155;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .content-body h2 {
    font-size: 1.45rem;
    color: var(--text-main);
    margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .content-body h2:first-of-type {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .content-body p {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
</style>
